pgturbohybrid depends on pgvector and contains code derived from pgvector's
HNSW index implementation. The derived portions retain the PostgreSQL License
terms and attribution from the upstream project.

pgvector is maintained by Andrew Kane and pgvector contributors and is
distributed under the PostgreSQL License.

pgturbohybrid is a separate experimental extension and is not an official
pgvector project.
